                        },
                        {
                            "text": "If character has a stewardship of 10, gain 1 stewardship",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Ward gains 5 prestige",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
